OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order in place for
OL,4,Afootball derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police will be drafted in for
OL,7,FRedditch United's Bank Holiday clash
OL,8,Fagainst Halesowen Town, West Mercia
OL,9,FPolice said.
OL,11,FA dispersal order will be in place in
OL,12,Fthe town from 11:00 and 19:00 BST for
OL,13,FMonday's game to prevent the potential
OL,14,Ffor anti-social behaviour, the force
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FMore than 1,000 supporters are expected
OL,18,Fto attend the match at The Valley
OL,19,Fstadium.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
