OL,3,GNEWSADispersal order in place for
OL,4,Afootball derby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be an increased police
OL,7,Fpresence near the stadium and train
OL,8,Fstation on Bromsgrove Road, as well as
OL,9,Faround Redditch town centre, before,
OL,10,Fduring and after the match, which
OL,11,Fstarts at 15:00 BST.
